{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xsVF3URYRO1795734435.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西班牙前央行行長德科斯，獲選為歐洲央行下任行長。</p><p></p><p>德科斯擊敗荷蘭央行前行長諾特，將成為歐洲央行自1998年成立以來的第五位行長，接替明年2月卸任的拉加德。</p><p></p><p>現年55歲的德科斯目前擔任國際結算銀行總經理，分析認為，他上任後的最大挑戰是遏抑通脹，歐元區10月的通脹率，升至百分之4。歐洲央行已分別於今年6月及9月，先後兩次各加息四分之一厘。市場普遍預期，歐洲央行將於12月再次加息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.887045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:14.699649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.194656+00:00","content_hash":"d7294bc41e5c17dd5f1dbdb988f52cc5575de0c78eb22598063ba96139e3d857","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.887045+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}